CHANGELOG
=========

v1.0.0 (2024)
-------------
- Initial release
- Browser-based IDE with Ace Editor integration
- Backend API for code execution simulation (server1.js)
- Multi-language support: Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, Java, C, C++, Rust, Go
- Stdin input support
- Multiple editor themes
- Adjustable font size
- index.html: main editor entry point
- kitchen-sink.html: full demo with all language/theme combinations
